<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Unholy Death Knights in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Phase 1 set bonuses are great, but not amazing. The 2 Piece bonus is the largest damage increase of the two, considering how much you are pressing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55090/scourge-strike">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_scourgestrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scourge Strike</span></a> in your DPS rotation. The 4 Piece is alright, but as Haste is not as much of a desireable Stat as it has been in previous expansions it ends up being a little underwhelming compared to the impact it has on Frost.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 14 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1123/battlegear-of-the-lost-catacomb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Battlegear of the Lost Catacomb</span></a></span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
